      "context_after": "据追风交易台消息，摩根大通在10月22日的研报中称，这场突如其来的“避险狂欢”由欧洲主权债风暴和纳斯达克科技股的持续疲软共同引爆，并非源于美国基本面的实质性改善。",
      "path": "assets/figure_001.png",
      "sha256": "e834a151effc89d6cb2d3dc44b99b706869ca194027ed1766841ae5c1a64a90c",
      "bytes": 146038,
      "width": 915,
      "height": 683,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c6403de4-1aa0-400f-b822-629f09644752.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bb2db1d0-a428-4a82-9861-5332e9843e56.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "展望后市，摩根大通认为， 尽管美国经济保持韧性，股票市场已成为利率定价的主导力量 。摩根大通股票团队此前指出，利率上升将对股票估值倍数形成压制——随着折现率提高和通胀预期上升，估值将受到压缩。根据不同的经济增长情景，这一压制效应在10年期收益率达到5%至6%之间时开始显现。",
      "path": "assets/figure_002.png",
      "sha256": "f3434fb15694aeb657f95066e2ffb46e6517e1e92666dc4addb65e6a56e1d224",
      "bytes": 159112,
      "width": 904,
      "height": 680,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bb2db1d0-a428-4a82-9861-5332e9843e56.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5f4513df-126c-4463-abdc-85ba5e98e6f9.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "尽管市场波动加剧，美债一级市场需求整体表现出色。",
      "path": "assets/figure_003.png",
      "sha256": "f2868955e17158424f7256a83fb01d4624ffa7f408870942d22b3525137e94c7",
      "bytes": 206042,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 552,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5f4513df-126c-4463-abdc-85ba5e98e6f9.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/11e2b27d-e11f-4da3-acfa-3e8397c495d8.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "中期限需求虽较2025年历史高位有所回落，但从历史维度看仍处于强劲水平。",
      "path": "assets/figure_004.png",
      "sha256": "95fa8efcdd92f2dbffcb47205e7383df625500cb39f47262817440f86cb6678a",
      "bytes": 149451,
      "width": 889,
      "height": 650,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/11e2b27d-e11f-4da3-acfa-3e8397c495d8.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c95ec824-4359-484f-8bbc-86eb03d0c80f.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "摩根大通判断， 此次外资需求增量主要集中在中长端，表明资金来源以外国私人投资者为主 （官方持有通常集中于短端，以便在金融压力时期更易变现）。这与8月份TIC数据相互印证——该数据显示，外国投资者在8月份净买入长期美债的速度为逾一年来最快，主要由外国私人需求拉动。",
      "path": "assets/figure_005.png",
      "sha256": "861c3664b23ada4419fb096287aff701f61001bb168fb2089911ecc9e885044c",
      "bytes": 124165,
      "width": 876,
      "height": 626,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/c95ec824-4359-484f-8bbc-86eb03d0c80f.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e9394977-745c-4ae8-95c0-22ca9fb4abc0.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "利率波动率上升的自然结果 ：尤其是日内波动率的提升，自然导致尾差扩大。拍卖尾差在3月份冲突引发市场波动时扩大，并在9月份收益率重新定价时再度飙升。",
      "path": "assets/figure_006.png",
      "sha256": "2b08734f5f254a778afa8ff1f4313748cd6f9bdb1365730839cd78c3b5eca4d6",
      "bytes": 109806,
      "width": 884,
      "height": 635,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e9394977-745c-4ae8-95c0-22ca9fb4abc0.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a40381de-530a-4a90-b814-eb51088804f5.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "长端是显著例外 ——长端拍卖尾差今年以来反而有所收窄。摩根大通认为，在未来数年融资缺口持续扩大的背景下，削减长端发行规模本已是不明智之举；而长端拍卖表现如此强劲，更进一步表明此类调整并无必要。",
      "path": "assets/figure_007.png",
      "sha256": "662feafd1843123654c6e86504531d32bbfeb3fade0014ee5bd7301a0fb326d2",
      "bytes": 125048,
      "width": 855,
      "height": 630,
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a40381de-530a-4a90-b814-eb51088804f5.png"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/ec2c4d03-6ba8-47ea-b462-bf387f15282c.png",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "摩根大通判断， 市场短期内可能在此区间附近整固，但在风险资产市场出现明确企稳乃至筑底信号之前，不建议逆势做空本轮反弹 。目前，多数风险资产市场仍在加速下行，部分已跌破关键支撑位，尚无企稳迹象。",
